        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset CNL, Grade 3 Carson Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Carson  Light Commercial Lever has an easy-to-clean shape that makes it ideal for light duty commercial settings. It is field reversible and will fit most pre-drilled doors. The Kwikset Carson lever will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. A grade 3 light commercial lever, it meets ADA requirements and has a 3 hour UL listing.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Carson Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors. Easy to install</li>\r\n<li>Smart Key system.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed lever.</li>\r\n<li>Lever functions satisfy 4.13.9 ADA requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Meets UL 3 hour fire rating for all functions.</li>\r\n<li>Dual torque springs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>5 Year Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset Carson  Light Commercial Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.56\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.31\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Outside lever fixed. Entry by key only. Inside lever always free (unlocked). Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate. \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
